# Test Stack

- Jest 30 + `jest.setup.js` global mocks (Redis, axios, winston, config, uuid)
- `supertest` for route/integration tests against Express app
- `node-mocks-http` for controller unit tests

# Style

- Mirror `src/` under `tests/` — `tests/controllers/`, `tests/services/`, `tests/routes/`
- Mock external integrations; do not connect to real Redis, Artemis, or Keycloak in unit tests
- Scripts: `npm test`, `npm run coverage` (`-i --forceExit`)
- Coverage output: `coverage/` with jest-sonar-reporter for SonarQube
